<p>Today's brief covers stories from 20 to 22 November.</p>

<figure class="dgm">
<div class="dgm-stack">
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Silicon</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span class="hl">Amazon and Decart<em>models on custom chips</em></span><span>RTX Spark desktops<em>local AI hardware</em></span></div></div>
<div class="dgm-tier"><small>Models</small><div class="dgm-nodes"><span>Inkling 2 Mini<em>open weights, laptop-sized</em></span></div></div>
